OL,3,GNEWSAFour police officers suspended in 
OL,4,Ainquiry into 'on-duty conduct'         
OL,6,FFour police officers in the north-east 
OL,7,Fof Scotland have been suspended amid   
OL,8,Finquiries into their "on-duty conduct".
OL,10,FBBC Scotland News understands two jury 
OL,11,Fcases have been deserted because of the
OL,12,Fsuspensions. The Crown Office and      
OL,13,FProcurator Fiscal Service (COPFS) could
OL,14,Fbring the cases back to court in the   
OL,15,Ffuture.                                
OL,17,FInquiries by Police Scotland's         
OL,18,FProfessional Standards Department (PSD)
OL,19,Fare ongoing.                           
OL,21,FThe reasons for the suspensions have   
OL,22,Fnot been given.                        
